netfosdl v1.0 - DOS FOSSIL Driver
GPLv3 real-mode FOSSIL for MS-DOS.
Drop-in for X00/BNU/ADF/NetFoss doors.
INT 14h, FSC-0015 rev 5 + FSC-0072.
Interrupt-driven 4KB RX ring buffer,
CTS/RTS flow control, 18 functions.
Real 8250/16550 UART, X00 cmdline.
TSR, proper resident sizing.
Verified: AX=1954h round-trip DOSBox-X.
FPC264IRC crew - 2026 - 4free
